{"title":"Rustscale","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Rustscale is a named <a href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium\">Copperhead</a> seen at level 20.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Rustscale</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ancient%20Battlefield\">Ancient Battlefield</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"rustscale\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>What it can drop</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a5b949298e5c9a12fd3b.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/rustscale-cowl-head\"><b>Rustscale Cowl</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Snakeskin Head)</span>: <b>1%</b> of kills (1 in 100), <b>5%</b> from an elite (1 in 20). <span class=\"muted\">15% of damage spells poison the primary target.</span></li>\n      <li><b>Gear every kill:</b> a piece from its tier, excellent or better, and a second piece 1 kill in 5.</li>\n      <li><b>Gold</b> worth about 5 ordinary kills.</li>\n      <li><b>Enchanted:</b> 1 kill in 100 enchants a piece (up to 9c, and only what its material can hold).</li>\n      <li><b>Elite:</b> a boss spawns elite 1 time in 100, and an elite makes its unique 5 times as likely.</li></ul>\n      <p class=\"muted\">From the game’s rules and its own guide. See <a href=\"#/guide/unique-items\">Unique items</a>.</p>\n      <h2>Drops players have recorded</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">19 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snakeskin-knick\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9728c594370aae49ebbb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snake-fang\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f1a8cba3a8479382b961.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snake Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snake-meat\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d15830124444cf29d721.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snake Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-medium\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/df992b2657b50a24d683.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snakeskin-arms\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b67d86c57e0ff1871024.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/b134e63b0f937131e7db.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Rustscale</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium\">Copperhead</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>20</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>198</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>58 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}